<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="600" cellspacing="5" height="400"><tbody><tr valign="top" height="50"><td teditid="c1r1" aeditid="c1r1" locked="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;"><p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;">Send Email To:&nbsp;</p><table width="100%" border="0" align="center" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;"><tbody><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" valign="bottom"><strong>India Telesales ACQ Users&nbsp; -&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></td><td nowrap="nowrap" valign="top">MO-IN-SF Request TS ACQ (SFrequesttsacq@monsterindia.com)</td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" valign="bottom"><strong>India Telesales RET Users&nbsp; -&nbsp;</strong></td><td nowrap="nowrap" valign="top">MO-IN-SF Request Retention (SFrequestretenstion@monsterindia.com)</td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" valign="bottom"><strong>India Fieldsales Users&nbsp; -</strong></td><td nowrap="nowrap" valign="top">MO-IN-SF Request Fieldsales (SFrequestfieldsales@monsterindia.com)</td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" valign="bottom"><strong>Monster College -&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></td><td nowrap="nowrap" valign="top">MO-IN-SF Request Fieldsales (SFrequestfieldsales@monsterindia.com)</td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" valign="bottom"><strong>&amp; IAF Users -</strong></td><td nowrap="nowrap" valign="top">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" valign="bottom"><strong>Gulf Users&nbsp; -</strong></td><td nowrap="nowrap" valign="top">MO-ME SF Request (MESFrequest@monstergulf.com)</td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" valign="bottom"><strong>SEA &amp; HK Users -</strong></td><td nowrap="nowrap" valign="top">MO-SEA SF Request (SEASFrequest@monster.com.sg)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" valign="bottom" style="padding-top: 15px;"><ul><li>To ensure that your request is processed correctly, please&nbsp;<u>DO NOT</u>&nbsp;<br>change the subject line of this message<br>please do not delete any fields when filling out template.</li><li>Requests to update Account Name and/or Primary Address will not be processed&nbsp;<br>without any one of the required Supporting Documents.*</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr valign="top" height="300"><td teditid="c1r2" aeditid="c1r2" locked="0" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;"><p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;"><strong>Current Primary Account Rep: &nbsp;<br></strong>Subject: Account Name/Address Change Request for Account:<br><br><u>The following field is required for account name change:</u>&nbsp;<br><br><strong>Change Account name to:&nbsp;</strong><br><br><u>One of the following fields is required for an address change:</u><br><br>Change primary address to:&nbsp;<br>Add secondary address:&nbsp;<br>Remove secondary address:<br><br><strong><u>Comments:</u></strong></p><p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;"><strong><u><br></u></strong></p><p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;"><strong><u>&nbsp;</u></strong></p><p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;"><strong><u><br></u></strong></p><p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;"><strong><u>*Supporting Documents:</u></strong></p><p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;"><strong><u><br></u></strong></p><p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;"><strong><u>&nbsp;</u></strong></p></td></tr><tr valign="top" height="50"><td teditid="c1r3" aeditid="c1r3" locked="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;"><p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;">&nbsp;</p><table width="100%" border="0" align="center" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="1" bgcolor="#bfbfbf" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;"><tbody><tr><td width="102" valign="bottom" nowrap="nowrap" bgcolor="#FFFFFF"><p>&nbsp;</p></td><td width="230" align="center" bgcolor="#FFFFFF"><strong>Registered legal entity to<br>Registered legal entity</strong><strong></strong><strong></strong></td><td width="196" align="center" bgcolor="#FFFFFF"><strong>Un-Registered entity to<br>Un-Registered entity</strong></td></tr><tr><td width="102" align="left" valign="top" bgcolor="#FFFFFF"><strong>Documents to be submitted</strong></td><td width="230" align="left" valign="top" bgcolor="#FFFFFF">Name change certificate issued by concerned registration authority (example: MCA India, SEC Philippines, Government of Dubai -Department of Economic Development, etc.)</td><td width="196" align="left" valign="top" bgcolor="#FFFFFF">Request letter on new client letter head/email. The contact person requesting for name change shall be same for both old entity and new entity</td></tr><tr><td width="102" align="left" valign="top" bgcolor="#FFFFFF"><strong>Examples</strong></td><td width="230" align="left" valign="top" bgcolor="#FFFFFF">Registered legal entities mean clients on MCA in India or clients registered with relevant registration authority like ACRA in Singapore, Department of Economic Development in Dubai etc.</td><td width="196" align="left" valign="top" bgcolor="#FFFFFF">Un - Registered legal entities means clients not on MCA, ACRA etc, however registered on some local registration firms</td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;"><br></p><p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;">For all the other categories like (<strong>Un-Registered entity to Registered legal entity, vice versa and One category of registered client to other category of registered client)&nbsp;</strong>new account should be creating instead of changing the name, hence the promotion request to be submitted instead of name change.</p><p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;"><br></p><p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;"><strong><u>Address proof may include the following:</u></strong></p><p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;"><strong><u><br></u></strong></p><p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;">Any document containing client name and new address to be updated. Such documents includes but not limited to CIN screenshot/VAT registration/Service tax registration/Bank Passbook or statement/Electricity Bill/Telephone Bill/ Adhar Card/Lease Deed with Photo, e-stamp and notarized/Webpage Contact address/Address mentioned on the client letter head/Business Card etc.<br><br><strong><u>Note:</u></strong>&nbsp;Any address change in Tally will be effective for invoice purpose, for future invoices only, however address change can happen in customer master.</p><p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;"><br></p><p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;">Any Exceptions apart from the above needs to be approved by Managing Director.</p></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[]]></td>
